{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":260149,"duration_api_ms":318698,"num_turns":19,"result":"All tank_core tests pass (241+ tests across all test files). The only failure is a pre-existing TUI test unrelated to this task. Build, clippy, and fmt all clean.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Implemented stage-structured shrimp population dynamics with a Lefkovitch cohort model. AnimalState now contains three StageCohort instances (juvenile at 0.05g, sub-adult at 0.08g, adult at 0.12g), each with independent count, reserve_g, condition_index, and maturation_accum. Deterministic forward transitions (juvenile→sub-adult at 30d base, sub-adult→adult at 20d base) are gated by per-stage condition thresholds and temperature-scaled. An explicit molt cycle with timer-based readiness, success/failure tracking, and failed_molt_accum mortality penalty is integrated. Stage-aware feeding (weight allocation 1.0/0.67/0.3), per-stage mortality (sensitivity 1.5x/1.2x/1.0x juveniles/sub-adults/adults), stage-aware reproduction (only adults become berried, clutch size condition-dependent, hatched juveniles funded from adult reserve), and per-stage bioload routing are all implemented. Save migration v4→v5 distributes legacy flat reserve proportionally across stages. Snapshot/TUI/API expose per-stage breakdown with backward-compatible total-population accessors (total_count, population_condition_index, feeding_units).\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Define StageCohort struct with count, reserve_g, condition_index, maturation_accum fields and Default impl in types/biology.rs\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Restructure AnimalState to contain adult, sub_adult, juvenile StageCohort instances plus berried_females_count subset bookkeeping, molt lifecycle fields, hourly stress accumulators, and egg cohort tracking\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add ShrimpRuntimeParams with stage transition timings (juvenile_to_subadult_days=30, subadult_to_adult_days=20), condition thresholds, molt interval, clutch size, and body composition parameters\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement backward-compatible accessor methods on AnimalState: total_count(), feeding_units(), population_condition_index(), total_reserve_g(), add_reserve_by_feeding_units(), try_spend_reserve_g(), transfer_dead_reserve_g()\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement stage-aware shrimp_feeding() with proportional allocation by feeding weight (adult=1.0, sub_adult=0.67, juvenile=0.3) and route_consumed_food() distributing retained reserve per-stage\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement per-stage update_condition() applying 8-factor condition model independently to each stage's condition_index with smoothing\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement explicit molt_cycle() with timer-based readiness, mineral/condition gates for success, failed_molt_accum penalty tracking, and molt stress blending\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement spawning() restricted to adult cohort with condition-dependent clutch sizing, EggCohort creation, and temperature/mineral/stability probability modifiers\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement egg_development() with per-cohort incubation advancement, clutch-resolution invariant, hatched juvenile funding from adult reserve, and resource-limited failure events\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement juvenile_to_subadult() and subadult_to_adult() deterministic forward transitions with fractional maturation accumulators, condition gates, temperature scaling, reserve-funded biomass growth, and proportional reserve transfer\",\n      \"order\": 10,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement stage-aware mortality() with per-stage sensitivity multipliers, failed molt penalty, maturation_accum scaling on death, and route_dead_shrimp_to_detritus() transferring body biomass plus per-stage reserve to fine detritus\",\n      \"order\": 11,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add save migration v4→v5 distributing legacy flat reserve/condition proportionally into StageCohort structs with sub_adult initialized at count=0 and idempotent safety check\",\n      \"order\": 12,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Update TankSnapshot with sub_adult_count field and population-weighted shrimp_condition_index from all three stages; update TUI biology and overview screens to display per-stage breakdown\",\n      \"order\": 13,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Expand N/C budget arrays to include sub-adult stage components and update biomass calculation helpers (shrimp_biomass_g) to use all three stage counts\",\n      \"order\": 14,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add comprehensive unit tests for feeding routing, oxygen-limited respiration, carbonate-condition integration, and stage transition mechanics\",\n      \"order\": 15,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo build: PASS - zero errors, all crates compile cleanly\",\n    \"cargo clippy: PASS - zero warnings across entire workspace\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check: PASS - all code formatted\",\n    \"cargo test -p tank_core: PASS - 241+ tests across 20 test suites, zero failures\",\n    \"Pre-existing TUI test failure (rejects_invalid_integer_counts) is unrelated to this task - from TrimPlants refactor in a different bead\",\n    \"AC1 verified: StageCohort with count/reserve_g/condition_index/maturation_accum; juvenile/sub_adult/adult stages in AnimalState; v4→v5 migration distributes legacy data\",\n    \"AC2 verified: Forward-only transitions juvenile→sub_adult→adult with fractional maturation accumulators, condition gates (0.3/0.4 thresholds), temperature scaling, reserve-funded biomass, counts conserved through transition and death paths\",\n    \"AC3 verified: Feeding proportional by stage weight, mortality with per-stage sensitivity (1.5x/1.2x/1.0x), only adults become berried, all stages contribute bioload through consumer routing contract\",\n    \"AC4 verified: TankSnapshot exposes adult_shrimp_count, sub_adult_count, juveniles_count, berried_females_count plus population-weighted condition_index; TUI biology screen shows all four stage counts; backward-compatible total_count() accessor\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"One pre-existing TUI test failure (rejects_invalid_integer_counts) from TrimPlants refactor is unrelated to this task and should be fixed in its own scope\",\n    \"Population condition index uses count-weighted average rather than biomass-weighted; acceptable approximation since per-stage conditions are available individually for systems that need them\",\n    \"Molt cycle parameters (28-day base interval, 0.15 failed_molt_mortality_scale, 0.3/0.5 accum increments) are initial estimates that may need tuning against observed Neocaridina biology - all exposed in ShrimpRuntimeParams for adjustment\",\n    \"Condition update applies the same target to all three stages (no stage-specific sensitivity modifiers beyond the separate condition_index tracking); future work could add juvenile_sensitivity as a condition multiplier if differentiation is needed\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f3264b97-7d21-4d74-83fa-57d9d666af5b"